Subject: image run host: each member held to its reach of the destinations kept, before the VM starts (D236)
Why: Hex's joint plan step 15 holds a harness to exactly the providers and the host its grants name. Where a request names each member's reach (Narrowing::members, vendor/shards change 0002, channel version 9), the run host refuses before the VM starts a run in which any member the image declares would reach other than that, reading each member's reach by name from the Agentfile it already holds (agentfile::named_reach): under D236's held a member reaches exactly its own names among those kept (Hex's lead, 2026-11-12).

